cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ACE in research or a deployment, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
title: "ACE, the African Context Engine"
abstract: >-
  Open source software that gives checked, local, citable knowledge for Africa on any phone
  (USSD, SMS/RCS, voice, WhatsApp and MCP), with a safety rail, Scam Shield and six decision services
  on dated public data, for 34 African countries in 32 languages, and a check that tells a person when ACE
  does not read their language yet. It includes the ACE tokenizer audit
  (benchmark/tokenizer-audit), which measures what 59 African language varieties cost against English on nine
  released tokenizers and scores unreleased tokenizers offline.
type: software
